    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin as a cumbersome Alien Drone.\u00a0 Groggy and hopeless.\u00a0 But through persistence, and by transferring your knowledge to the next drone, may you come to realize it is the next generation that matters. The power of your experience will pass down to the next drone and the next drone and maybe one day someone will break free of the torment of the hive mind.\u00a0 May your efforts not be in vain if only each generation persists to become more and more powerful.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794240/extras/ac7b587dd4ef2e3b4c44ecf97fba1219.avif?t=1739340893\" width=548 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be an Alien Drone severed and freed from the control of the Hive Mind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794240/extras/88629cd39f027d1a1ea1be17d6bb8dea.avif?t=1739340893\" width=548 height=160 /></span>Progressively Powerup with every run to become overpowered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794240/extras/9e52e6443ff7d2d5e7e07a16894b3c19.avif?t=1739340893\" width=548 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek to put an end to the Hive Mind and liberate your fellow Drones so they can finally be free and live in peace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run &amp; Gun Action Rogue Shoot 'em Up centered around a hybrid-style procedural generation, 120 audio tracks, explosion &amp; laser beams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited procedural generation with Five Game Modes to serve different types of players: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Optional Cheat Mode: Become instantly overpowered and unlock all stages but disable achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easy Mode: Retain All Progress  and become overpowered quickly over time (Overpower mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Casual Mode: Retain world Progress but gain no ability progress (World-lock mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hard Mode: Retain Abilities but lose World Progress on Death. (Rogue-lite mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Expert Mode: All Game Progress lost on death. (permadeath mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress with every run </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Stats &amp; Abilities after completing areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Stats &amp; Abilities after failure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectable Tech-Alterations power-ups</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 area themes with randomized aspects and versions on each stage run including randomized enemy and hazard spawns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 Bosses set to each themed Stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay Completed themed areas with the optional Brutal Mode for power-up bonuses  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with over 120 Original Catchy Audio loop Tracks</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin as a cumbersome Alien Drone.\u00a0 Groggy and hopeless.\u00a0 But through persistence, and by transferring your knowledge to the next drone, may you come to realize it is the next generation that matters. The power of your experience will pass down to the next drone and the next drone and maybe one day someone will break free of the torment of the hive mind.\u00a0 May your efforts not be in vain if only each generation persists to become more and more powerful.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794240/extras/ac7b587dd4ef2e3b4c44ecf97fba1219.avif?t=1739340893\" width=548 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be an Alien Drone severed and freed from the control of the Hive Mind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794240/extras/88629cd39f027d1a1ea1be17d6bb8dea.avif?t=1739340893\" width=548 height=160 /></span>Progressively Powerup with every run to become overpowered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794240/extras/9e52e6443ff7d2d5e7e07a16894b3c19.avif?t=1739340893\" width=548 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek to put an end to the Hive Mind and liberate your fellow Drones so they can finally be free and live in peace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run &amp; Gun Action Rogue Shoot 'em Up centered around a hybrid-style procedural generation, 120 audio tracks, explosion &amp; laser beams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited procedural generation with Five Game Modes to serve different types of players: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Optional Cheat Mode: Become instantly overpowered and unlock all stages but disable achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easy Mode: Retain All Progress  and become overpowered quickly over time (Overpower mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Casual Mode: Retain world Progress but gain no ability progress (World-lock mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hard Mode: Retain Abilities but lose World Progress on Death. (Rogue-lite mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Expert Mode: All Game Progress lost on death. (permadeath mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress with every run </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Stats &amp; Abilities after completing areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Stats &amp; Abilities after failure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectable Tech-Alterations power-ups</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 area themes with randomized aspects and versions on each stage run including randomized enemy and hazard spawns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 Bosses set to each themed Stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay Completed themed areas with the optional Brutal Mode for power-up bonuses  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with over 120 Original Catchy Audio loop Tracks</p>",
